                                "en": "The quick <w>asking</w> of questions made it easier for us to conduct the interview."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Bolesne <w>zadanie</w> ciosu przesądziło o wyniku walki.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Болезненное <w>нанесение</w> удара предопределило исход боя.",
                                "en": "The painful <w>inflicting</w> of a blow decided the outcome of the fight."
                            }
                        }
